---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy | Sablay" description="How Sablay collects, uses and protects personal information on this website." type="website">
  <section class="bg-background py-section" data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:y5a2rd">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-gutter" data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:pffnzk">
      <h1 class="text-h1 font-bold" data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:yc2gay">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="mt-6 text-lead text-muted-foreground" data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:y33jw6">This page explains what personal information Sablay collects through this website, how we use it and the choices you have.</p>

      <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col gap-8 text-muted-foreground" data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:pffnzl">
        <div data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:pffnzm">
          <h2 class="text-h3 font-semibold text-foreground" data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:dlu4ur">Who we are</h2>
          <p class="mt-3" data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:y33jw7">Sablay is an IT consulting company based in Brussels, Belgium. You can contact us at <a href="mailto:info@sablay.be" class="text-primary" data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:tu2ld6">info@sablay.be</a>.</p>
        </div>
        <div data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:pffnzn">
          <h2 class="text-h3 font-semibold text-foreground" data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:dlu4uq">Information we collect</h2>
          <p class="mt-3" data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:y33jw8">When you book a consultation or send us a message, we receive the details you choose to share, such as your name, email address, company and a description of your project. We do not use analytics or advertising cookies on this website.</p>
        </div>
        <div data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:pffnzo">
          <h2 class="text-h3 font-semibold text-foreground" data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:dlu4up">How we use your information</h2>
          <p class="mt-3" data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:y33jw9">We use the information you provide only to respond to your enquiry, arrange a consultation and, where relevant, prepare a proposal. We do not sell or rent your personal information.</p>
        </div>
        <div data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:pffnzp">
          <h2 class="text-h3 font-semibold text-foreground" data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:dlu4uo">How long we keep it</h2>
          <p class="mt-3" data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:y33jwv">We keep enquiry details only for as long as needed to handle your request and any follow-up work, after which they are deleted or anonymised.</p>
        </div>
        <div data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:pffnzq">
          <h2 class="text-h3 font-semibold text-foreground" data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:dlu4un">Your rights</h2>
          <p class="mt-3" data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:y33jww">Under the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR), you may ask to see, correct or delete the personal information we hold about you, and you may object to or restrict its use. To make a request, email <a href="mailto:info@sablay.be" class="text-primary" data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:tu2ld5">info@sablay.be</a>.</p>
        </div>
        <div data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:pffnzr">
          <h2 class="text-h3 font-semibold text-foreground" data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:dlu4um">Changes to this policy</h2>
          <p class="mt-3" data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:y33jwx">We may update this policy from time to time. The date of the latest change is shown below.</p>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm" data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:y33jwy">Last updated: November 2026</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
